    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85932" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποταίνιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			S.
			<u>Fr.</u>
			149.5
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fresh, new,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέφανος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					10(11).60
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἷμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					1055
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Eu.</u>
				282
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλφιτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Acut.</u>
					37
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Nat.Mul.</u>
				15
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τῶν π. προσθήκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>CA</u>
					2.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>new, unexpected, unheard of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῆτις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					16.51
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῆμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					102
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάταγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Th.</u>
					239
				</span></i>
			 (lyr., dub.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					849
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδοναί</span>
				Id.<u>Fr.</u>l.c. (Expld. as 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσφατος</span>
			 by <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1106.23
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i> (who calls it Doric, i.e. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτί,
				αἶνος</span>), but it is found in <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i> (v. supr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Bacch.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Erot.
			</span></i>)</div>
